                    span class=tagData Structuresspan
                div
            div

            div class=card
                div
                    div class=card-header
                        i class=fa-solid fa-database card-iconi
                        div class=card-links
                            a href=httpsgithub.comVenkateshPadam target=_blanki class=fa-brands fa-githubia
                        div
                    div
                    h4Full-Stack Database Portalh4
                    pRobust management platform with secure user authentication, CRUD operations, and optimized database queries.p
                div
